OL,3,GNEWSA'Demeaning' and 'absurd': The
OL,4,Abacklash against a hugging grandparents
OL,5,Aconsent ad
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the consent campaign that's
OL,8,Fsparked heated debate across Ireland
OL,9,Fand beyond - so why has a social media
OL,10,Fad about getting a hug from your
OL,11,Fgrandparents been pulled?
OL,13,FThe ad, described by an Irish
OL,14,Fgovernment minister as "demeaning to
OL,15,Fgrandparents", sees a house's front
OL,16,Fdoor opening to reveal an elderly
OL,17,Fcouple.
OL,19,FThey hug their grandson and lean into
OL,20,Fembrace their granddaughter, who looks
OL,21,Funcomfortable before it quickly cuts to
OL,22,Fa graphic and voiceover.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
